EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

We have received your request for a reconciliation, as provided for in Section 2.3 of the Agreement. In order to process your request please provide us with the last two months of bank statements.  We need to receive those within the next five (5) days for us to process your request, otherwise your request will be voided. Once we receive the statements, we will process your request and notify you of any adjustment to the remittance amount going forward.



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
